{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>short</strong> and <strong>relaxing</strong> Plinko-style <strong>INCREMENTAL game</strong> where you shoot gumballs at gears and buy upgrades to make bigger and bigger numbers until you break the game! Enjoy the explosive sense of achievement!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gumball Fun:\u00a0</strong>shoot gumballs at gears and enjoy your time by watching them bounce and spin around! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/e371cb5fb417e0904c11ac66934f50ce.poster.avif?t=1767709898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/e371cb5fb417e0904c11ac66934f50ce.webm?t=1767709898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/e371cb5fb417e0904c11ac66934f50ce.mp4?t=1767709898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Upgrades: </strong>buy upgrades to achieve explosive number growth in unique and surprising ways!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/d733d930778d8995f717a6c18dde5971.poster.avif?t=1767709898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/d733d930778d8995f717a6c18dde5971.webm?t=1767709898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/d733d930778d8995f717a6c18dde5971.mp4?t=1767709898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p clas